OL,3,AUK foreign secretary making statement
OL,4,Aon sanctions for Israeli settlements in
OL,5,Aoccupied West Bank
OL,6,
OL,7,FUK Foreign Secretary Ed Miliband is
OL,8,Foutlining the UK's plans to impose
OL,9,Fsanctions on trade from Israeli
OL,10,Fsettlements in the illegally occupied
OL,11,FWest Bank - watch live above
OL,13,FAll Israeli settlements in the West
OL,14,FBank are illegal under international
OL,15,Flaw. The UK sanctions come as Israel
OL,16,Fplans to develop 1,200 new homes in the
OL,17,Foccupied territory
OL,19,FSettler attacks on Palestinians have
OL,20,Falso increased this year, with the UN
OL,21,Fsaying injuries have risen to an
OL,22,Faverage of three a day
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
