OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier, Israeli and the US officials
OL,8,Fwarned the UK over the plans, with
OL,9,FIsrael's President Isaac Herzog calling
OL,10,Fthem a "grave miscalculation"
OL,12,FIsraeli Security minister Itamar
OL,13,FBen-Gvir calls on the Israeli
OL,14,Fgovernment to close the British
OL,15,Fconsulate in East Jerusalem, saying
OL,16,Fthis should be the response to "British
OL,17,Faudacity"
OL,19,FMeanwhile, US ambassador to Israel Mike
OL,20,FHuckabee tells the BBC British firms
OL,21,Fcould be "banned" from doing business
OL,22,Fin a number of US state
